    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's hard to just \"be\" when the \"being\" is so heavy. you're saying i should lean into the silence... but isn't that just a poetic way of saying i should stop fighting? if the struggle is what's causing the pain, and the struggle is pointless because none of this lasts... isn't the most logical way to find that relief just to let go entirely?",
